<title>DUBAI: Saudi Aramco cuts bunker fuel prices.</title>
<headline>Saudi Aramco cuts bunker fuel prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco has cut A-960 bunker fuel prices by $2 a tonne to $101 from Ras Tanura-Dammam and $103 from Jeddah-Yanbu effective February 13, the firm said.</p>
<p>A-888 bunker diesel from the Red Sea ports is cut $11 a tonne to $206. Gulf A-888 is unchanged at $211.</p>
</text>
